        <h3>Kevin Natanael Garcia</h3>
        <p class="muted role">Founder • Grade 12</p>
        <p>Kevin founded this group to try to change the course of many boys and girls and to show regardless of background, barriers, and fear of the unknown. It is never too late to become the best you and run after those dreams.</p>
        <p>His biggest goal is to expand to various counties all over FL, keep our promise to every person we reach out to one day and not so long from today, expand world wide because why not?!</p>
        <p>What he has learned from starting this is that its very stressful, but has learned to value every single little thing from the first meeting.</p>
        <p>His favorite part of being a leader is knowing that this will make a difference to many kids out there and being hopeful to one day look back at this and be proud of one idea.</p>
        <p><em>“I’m here for a reason.” — Whiplash</em></p>
